### Apply to job 1 -> saves applicationId
POST http://localhost:8083/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "{{jobId}}",
  "coverLetter": "I have 3 years of Java and Spring experience.",
  "resumeUrl": "https://example.com/resume.pdf"
}

> {% client.global.set("applicationId", response.body.id); %}

### Apply again -> 409
POST http://localhost:8083/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "{{jobId}}",
  "coverLetter": "Again"
}

### Job doesn't exist -> 404 (gRPC NOT_FOUND)
POST http://localhost:8083/applications
Authorization: Bearer {{candidateToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "jobId": "00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000",
  "coverLetter": "Ghost job"
}